.TH NN-HASH 1 "2026" "nn 0.1.0" "NN Manual"
.SH NAME
nn-hash \- hash a model artifact, graph, or tensor
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B nn hash [options] <model>
.SH DESCRIPTION
SHA-256 of the file, canonical graph, weights, or a named tensor.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-graph
Hash canonical graph.
.TP
.B \-\-weights
Hash weight payloads.
.TP
.B \-\-tensor NAME
Hash one tensor.
.TP
.B \-\-canonical
Hash canonical representation.
.SH EXIT STATUS
0 success.
.SH EXAMPLES
.nf
nn hash model.onnx --weights
.fi
.SH SEE ALSO
nn-diff(1), nn-canonicalize(1)
